HB0297 Fire suppression and restoration funding-2.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Connolly and Larsen, L and
Senator(s) Crago
AN ACT relating to wildfires; providing appropriations; authorizing grants and
expenditures; creating a steering committee; specifying duties of the executive
director of the Wyoming wildlife and natural resource trust account board;
providing for the transfer of funds; authorizing borrowing; repealing prior
borrowing authorization; and providing for effective dates.
